[6565]="Kill Lorgus Jett in Blackfathom Deeps and then return to Je'neu Sancrea in Ashenvale.",
[6569]="Travel to Blackrock Spire and collect 20 Black Dragonspawn Eyes. Return to Myranda the Hag when the task is complete.",
[6602]="Travel to Blackrock Spire and slay General Drakkisath. Gather his blood and return it to Rexxar.",
