[7041]="Fill the Coated Cerulean Vial at the orange crystal pool in Maraudon. Use the Filled Cerulean Vial on the Vylestem Vines to force the corrupted Noxxious Scion to emerge. Heal 8 plants by killing these Noxxious Scion, then return to Talendria in Nijel's Point.",
[7044]="Recover the two parts of the Scepter of Celebras: the Celebrian Rod and the Celebrian Diamond. Find a way to speak with Celebras.",
[7046]="Assist Celebras the Redeemed while he creates the Scepter of Celebras. Speak with him when the ritual is complete.",
[7064]="Slay Princess Theradras and return to Selendra near Shadowprey Village in Desolace.",
